{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"元素范畴"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"元素范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 的<strong>元素范畴</strong> (category of elements) $\\mathsf{El}(F)$ 是如下范畴,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>其对象为 $(c,x)$, 其中 $c\\in\\mathcal C$, $x\\in F(c)$;</li>\n<li>态射 $(c,x) \\to (d,y)$ 为 $f\\colon c\\to d$, $F(f)(x) = y$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>换言之, $\\mathsf{El}(F)$ 是如下的"},{"Local":{"url":"松拉回","text":"松拉回"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><figure><img src=\"./元素范畴-1.svg\" class=\"color-invert\"/></figure></p>\n"}]}}